invariant: INV-14
file: quic.c
catches: quic_loop_webpki
reason: the webpki ch_quic_init hashes the configuration for a session that
  takes tickets but leaves ch_tls.takes_tickets at 0. So handshake_post.c
  gives no ticket to on_ticket, and no QUIC session can resume. The
  loop's full handshake requires one ticket.

--- old
    q->t.takes_tickets = (uint8_t)webpki_takes_tickets(cfg);
    if (q->t.takes_tickets) {
--- new
    if (webpki_takes_tickets(cfg)) {
